# Lovable injects this automatically in hosted/preview builds.
# For LOCAL development you must provide it yourself, or plant
# identification (the upload feature) will fail with a clear
# "LOVABLE_API_KEY is missing" error.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (Node dev) or `.dev.vars` (Cloudflare/Wrangler)
# and paste your key:
LOVABLE_API_KEY=
